In this petition, petitioner seeks for the following reliefs and interim reliefs:-
"PRAYER (i) To quash the impugned Order bearing No.EC420, dated 09.12.2024, produced at Annexure-'M' issued by the 2nd Respondent, rejecting the approval for the year 2024-25, by issuing a writ of certiorari.
(ii) Direct the respondents to grant the approval for the year 2024-25 by issuing a writ of mandamus;
